msgid "Disciple.Tools - Autolink"
msgstr "Disciple.Tools - Automatska poveznica"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: disciple-tools-autolink.php
msgid "https://github.com/DiscipleTools/disciple-tools-autolink"
msgstr "https://github.com/DiscipleTools/disciple-tools-autolink"

#. Description of the plugin
#: disciple-tools-autolink.php
msgid ""
"Provides a simplified interface for managing and visualizing your Disciple."
"Tools network. Share access with your downstream leaders to easily build "
"your group tree."
msgstr ""
"Pruža pojednostavljeno sučelje za upravljanje i vizualizaciju vaše mreže "
"Disciple.Tools. Podijelite pristup sa svojim voditeljima kako biste "
"jednostavno izgradili hijerarhiju svoje grupe."

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: disciple-tools-autolink.php
